#. odoo-javascript
msgid ""
"Bonuscard returned a discount, but it could not be applied to the order. "
"Please configure a discount product in POS settings."
msgstr ""
"Bonuscard returnerade en rabatt, men den kunde inte tillämpas på ordern. "
"Konfigurera en rabattprodukt i POS-inställningarna."

